# docker-compose.local.yml 용 환경 변수 예시
# 사용법: cp .env.example .env  (그리고 필요한 값 채우기)

POSTGRES_DB=dortfolio
POSTGRES_USER=dortfolio
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=dortfolio
POSTGRES_PORT=5432

FASTAPI_PORT=8000
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# JWT Configuration
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret_key_here

# Mail Configuration
MAIL_USERNAME=dotfolio.cotato@gmail.com
MAIL_PASSWORD=your_google_app_password_here

# Google OAuth Configuration
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your_google_client_id_here
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your_google_client_secret_here